#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn about quantum information, from states and measurements to quantum circuits and entanglement."
msgstr "Pelajari tentang informasi kuantum, mulai dari keadaan dan pengukuran hingga circuit kuantum dan entanglement."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Ikhtisar"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Ikhtisar {#overview}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/basics-of-quantum-information/hero.avif)\n"
msgstr "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/basics-of-quantum-information/hero.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Welcome to *Basics of quantum information,* the first course in the *Understanding quantum information and computation* series comprising the following courses:\n"
msgstr "Selamat datang di *Dasar-dasar informasi kuantum,* kursus pertama dalam seri *Memahami informasi dan komputasi kuantum* yang terdiri dari kursus-kursus berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Basics of quantum information (this course)\n"
msgstr "Dasar-dasar informasi kuantum (kursus ini)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Fundamentals of quantum algorithms](/learning/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms)\n"
msgstr "[Dasar-dasar algoritma kuantum](/learning/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[General formulation of quantum information](/learning/courses/general-formulation-of-quantum-information)\n"
msgstr "[Formulasi umum informasi kuantum](/learning/courses/general-formulation-of-quantum-information)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Foundations of quantum error correction](/learning/courses/foundations-of-quantum-error-correction)\n"
msgstr "[Fondasi koreksi error kuantum](/learning/courses/foundations-of-quantum-error-correction)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course begins with an introduction to the mathematics of quantum information, including a description of quantum information for both single and multiple systems. It then moves on to quantum circuits, which provide a standard way to describe quantum computations. Finally, three fundamentally important examples connected with the phenomenon of quantum entanglement are explained: quantum teleportation, superdense coding, and the CHSH game (also known as the CHSH inequality).\n"
msgstr "Kursus ini dimulai dengan pengantar matematika informasi kuantum, termasuk deskripsi informasi kuantum untuk sistem tunggal maupun sistem ganda. Kemudian berlanjut ke Circuit kuantum, yang menyediakan cara standar untuk menggambarkan komputasi kuantum. Terakhir, tiga contoh yang sangat penting yang berkaitan dengan fenomena entanglement kuantum dijelaskan: teleportasi kuantum, superdense coding, dan permainan CHSH (juga dikenal sebagai ketidaksetaraan CHSH).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course is intended for students, professionals, and hobbyists in fields such as computer science, physics, engineering, and mathematics who are eager to gain knowledge on the theoretical foundations of quantum information and computation.\n"
msgstr "Kursus ini ditujukan untuk mahasiswa, profesional, dan penghobi di bidang seperti ilmu komputer, fisika, teknik, dan matematika yang ingin mendapatkan pengetahuan tentang fondasi teoritis informasi dan komputasi kuantum.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended background {#recommended-background}"
msgstr "Latar belakang yang disarankan {#recommended-background}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To make the most out of this course, we recommend familiarity with basic linear algebra, complex numbers, and elementary mathematical notions including sets and functions. The following sources are a few among many that cover this material:\n"
msgstr "Untuk mendapatkan hasil maksimal dari kursus ini, kami merekomendasikan keakraban dengan aljabar linear dasar, bilangan kompleks, dan konsep matematika dasar termasuk himpunan dan fungsi. Sumber-sumber berikut adalah beberapa di antara banyak yang mencakup materi ini:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Khan Academy: Linear algebra](https://www.khanacademy.org/math/linear-algebra)\n"
msgstr "[Khan Academy: Aljabar linear](https://www.khanacademy.org/math/linear-algebra)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   In this video series, Sal Khan introduces key concepts in linear algebra that we will rely upon.\n"
msgstr "   Dalam seri video ini, Sal Khan memperkenalkan konsep-konsep kunci dalam aljabar linear yang akan kita andalkan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Stephen Friedberg, Arnold Insel, and Lawrence Spence. [Linear Algebra](https://www.pearson.com/en-us/subject-catalog/p/linear-algebra/P200000006185/9780137515424)\n"
msgstr "Stephen Friedberg, Arnold Insel, dan Lawrence Spence. [Linear Algebra](https://www.pearson.com/en-us/subject-catalog/p/linear-algebra/P200000006185/9780137515424)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   This book on linear algebra covers the material we require, and also includes appendices on sets, functions, and complex numbers.\n"
msgstr "   Buku tentang aljabar linear ini mencakup materi yang kita butuhkan, dan juga mencakup lampiran tentang himpunan, fungsi, dan bilangan kompleks.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sheldon Axler. [Linear Algebra Done Right](https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-3-319-11080-6)\n"
msgstr "Sheldon Axler. [Linear Algebra Done Right](https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-3-319-11080-6)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   A classic text on linear algebra suitable for those at or beyond an advanced undergraduate level.\n"
msgstr "   Teks klasik tentang aljabar linear yang cocok untuk mereka yang berada di atau melampaui tingkat sarjana lanjutan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ricky Shadrach and Rod Pierce. [Introduction to Sets](https://www.mathsisfun.com/sets/sets-introduction.html)\n"
msgstr "Ricky Shadrach dan Rod Pierce. [Introduction to Sets](https://www.mathsisfun.com/sets/sets-introduction.html)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   A beginner-level web page on sets that may help to bring some readers up to speed.\n"
msgstr "   Halaman web tingkat pemula tentang himpunan yang mungkin membantu beberapa pembaca untuk memahaminya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "John K. Hunter. [An Introduction to Real Analysis: Chapter 1](https://www.math.ucdavis.edu/~hunter/intro_analysis_pdf/ch1.pdf)\n"
msgstr "John K. Hunter. [An Introduction to Real Analysis: Chapter 1](https://www.math.ucdavis.edu/~hunter/intro_analysis_pdf/ch1.pdf)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   The first chapter of these lecture notes includes a more formal and detailed introduction to sets and functions.\n"
msgstr "   Bab pertama dari catatan kuliah ini mencakup pengantar yang lebih formal dan terperinci tentang himpunan dan fungsi.\n"

